{
  "info": {
    "name": "04 - Tipos de Pago (half_upfront & daily) - NUEVO MODELO",
    "description": "Prueba los diferentes tipos de pago implementados:\n\n**✨ NUEVO MODELO:**\n- Incluye `roomGuestAssignments` para asignar huéspedes a habitaciones\n\n**Tipos de pago:**\n1. full - Pago completo al inicio (ya probado en colecciones 01-03)\n2. half_upfront - 50% inicial, 50% a mitad de estadía\n3. daily - Pago día por día durante la estadía\n\n**Esta colección contiene 2 folders:**\n- Folder A: Test de half_upfront (4 noches, paga 50% al inicio)\n- Folder B: Test de daily (4 noches, paga día por día)\n\n**Nota:** Esta colección solo prueba la CREACIÓN de reservas con estos tipos.\nLa validación de pagos durante la estadía se implementará en endpoints futuros.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Folder A - Half Upfront (50% inicial)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Token recibido\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"token\", jsonData.token);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{receptionistEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{receptionistPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Crear Huésped",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Huésped creado\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"guestId\", jsonData.guest.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identificationNumber\": \"18567890-1\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Ana\",\n  \"paternalLastName\": \"Rodríguez\",\n  \"maternalLastName\": \"Castro\",\n  \"email\": \"ana.rodriguez.half@test.com\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"+56912345004\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"1992-06-18\",\n  \"gender\": \"female\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/guests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["guests"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Buscar Habitación",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Habitación encontrada\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"roomId1\", jsonData.availableRooms[0].id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/search-availability?checkInDate=2025-11-10T15:00:00.000Z&checkOutDate=2025-11-14T11:00:00.000Z&guests=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reservations", "search-availability"],
              "query": [
                {"key": "checkInDate", "value": "2025-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},
                {"key": "checkOutDate", "value": "2025-11-14T11:00:00.000Z"},
                {"key": "guests", "value": "1"}
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Calcular Precio (4 noches)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Precio calculado\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    ",
                  "    const total = jsonData.total;",
                  "    const halfAmount = Math.round(total * 0.5);",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"calculatedTotal\", total);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"halfAmount\", halfAmount);",
                  "    ",
                  "    console.log('Total:', total, '| Half (50%):', halfAmount);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roomIds\": [{{roomId1}}],\n  \"services\": [],\n  \"checkInDate\": \"2025-11-10T15:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"checkOutDate\": \"2025-11-14T11:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"guests\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/calculate-price",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reservations", "calculate-price"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Crear Reserva (half_upfront)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Reserva creada exitosamente\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"✅ Status 'confirmed' (pago cash 50%)\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.status).to.equal('confirmed');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"✅ paid_amount = 50% del total\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const expectedHalf = pm.environment.get('halfAmount');",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.reservation.paidAmount).to.equal(expectedHalf);",
                  "    console.log('Paid:', jsonData.reservation.paidAmount, '| Expected 50%:', expectedHalf);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Guardar reservationId\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"reservationId\", jsonData.reservation.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mainGuestId\": {{guestId}},\n  \"roomIds\": [{{roomId1}}],\n  \"checkInDate\": \"2025-11-10T15:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"checkOutDate\": \"2025-11-14T11:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"guestCount\": 1,\n  \"channel\": \"reception\",\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"cash\",\n  \"paymentAmount\": {{halfAmount}},\n  \"paymentType\": \"half_upfront\",\n  \"roomGuestAssignments\": [\n    {\n      \"roomId\": {{roomId1}},\n      \"guestIds\": [{{guestId}}]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reservations"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Ver Pagos",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"✅ Payment type es 'half_upfront'\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.payments[0].paymentType).to.equal('half_upfront');",
                  "    console.log('Payment Type:', jsonData.payments[0].paymentType);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["reservations", "{{reservationId}}", "payments"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
